      "claim": "Durian contains high levels of dietary fiber, fat, and simple sugars, along with sulfur-containing volatile compounds.",
      "evidence": "Nutritional data for Durio zibethinus indicates approximately 3.8g fiber, 5g fat, and 27g sugar per 100g, plus distinct sulfurous aromas.",
      "weight": 0.25,
